{"seq":2,"slug":"human-health-risk","title":"人体健康风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/environmental-toxicology/risk/human-health-risk","wordCount":1745,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"人体健康风险\">人体健康风险</h1><p>「这片污染场地能不能改建成幼儿园？」「这口井的水还能喝吗？」「鱼里这点汞，孕妇吃了要紧吗？」这些问题最终都需要一个量化的答案，而给出答案的工具就是人体健康风险评估。它与 <a href=\"ecological-risk\">生态风险评估</a> 共享「暴露对照危害」的基本逻辑，但保护对象从种群收窄到具体的人，尤其是其中最脆弱的个体。这套方法把本 hub 前面所有内容收束到一个数字上：用 <a href=\"../foundations/dose-response\">剂量-反应关系</a> 提供的毒性基准，对接 <a href=\"../fate-exposure/exposure-assessment\">暴露评估</a> 给出的人体暴露量，最终输出一个可与「可接受风险」比较的结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>美国国家科学院 1983 年确立的「四步法」至今仍是全球人体健康风险评估的通用框架。四步前后衔接，前两步刻画危害、后两步落实到具体人群并给出风险数值。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[1 危害识别&lt;br/&gt;该物质会致何种健康损害?] --&gt; B[2 剂量-反应评估&lt;br/&gt;多大剂量致多大效应?]&#10;  C[3 暴露评估&lt;br/&gt;人实际接触多少?] --&gt; D[4 风险表征&lt;br/&gt;整合并量化风险]&#10;  B --&gt; D&#10;  A --&gt; C&#10;  D --&gt; E{风险是否可接受}&#10;  E --&gt; F[风险管理决策]\">flowchart TD\n  A[1 危害识别&lt;br/&gt;该物质会致何种健康损害?] --&gt; B[2 剂量-反应评估&lt;br/&gt;多大剂量致多大效应?]\n  C[3 暴露评估&lt;br/&gt;人实际接触多少?] --&gt; D[4 风险表征&lt;br/&gt;整合并量化风险]\n  B --&gt; D\n  A --&gt; C\n  D --&gt; E{风险是否可接受}\n  E --&gt; F[风险管理决策]</pre><p>风险评估对两类毒性效应走截然不同的量化路径，这一分叉源于 <a href=\"../foundations/dose-response\">剂量-反应关系</a> 中的有阈/无阈之争，下表对比。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>非致癌效应（有阈）</th>\n<th>致癌效应（无阈，遗传毒性）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基本假设</td>\n<td>存在安全阈值</td>\n<td>任何剂量都有非零风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键基准</td>\n<td>参考剂量 RfD / 参考浓度 RfC</td>\n<td>斜率因子 SF</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险指标</td>\n<td>危害商 HQ、危害指数 HI</td>\n<td>终生致癌风险概率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可接受界</td>\n<td>HQ &lt; 1</td>\n<td>风险约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"危害识别与证据整合\">危害识别与证据整合</h2><p>第一步危害识别回答「这个物质能不能、以及会造成什么健康损害」。证据来自三类来源：人群流行病学研究（最直接但常有混杂）、实验动物研究（可控但有跨物种外推问题）、以及机制研究（<a href=\"../foundations/toxicity-mechanisms\">毒性作用机制</a> 提供的体外与计算证据）。</p>\n<p>对致癌性等关键终点，权威机构会做正式的证据分级。例如国际癌症研究机构（IARC）将物质按致癌证据强度分为 1 类（确定）、2A（很可能）、2B（可能）等。需要强调的是，IARC 的分类反映「证据有多确凿」而非「危害有多大」——这是公众常见的误读。危害识别还要确定<strong>关键效应（critical effect）</strong>：在最低剂量下出现的、有害的、与人相关的效应，它将成为下一步推导基准的依据，其确定依赖 <a href=\"../foundations/toxicity-mechanisms\">毒性作用机制</a> 中对靶器官的理解。</p>\n<h2 id=\"非致癌风险-从基准点到参考剂量\">非致癌风险：从基准点到参考剂量</h2><p>对有阈的非致癌效应，目标是推导一个「终生每日暴露也不致明显有害」的<strong>参考剂量（RfD，经口）<strong>或</strong>参考浓度（RfC，吸入）</strong>。其推导从 <a href=\"../foundations/dose-response\">剂量-反应关系</a> 中的基准点出发——优先用现代的 BMDL，其次 NOAEL——再除以一系列<strong>不确定性系数（UF）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">U</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><mo>⋯</mo></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{RfD} = \\frac{\\mathrm{POD}}{\\mathrm{UF}_1 \\times \\mathrm{UF}_2 \\times \\cdots}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">RfD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">UF</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">UF</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">POD</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每个 UF（通常各取 10）对应一类外推不确定性：动物到人的种间差异、人群内个体差异（保护敏感人群）、亚慢性到慢性的时长外推、用 LOAEL 代替 NOAEL 等。多个 UF 连乘，使最终 RfD 往往比观察到效应的剂量低几百到几千倍，体现保护性。</p>\n<p>有了 RfD，把它与 <a href=\"../fate-exposure/exposure-assessment\">暴露评估</a> 算出的实际日均摄入剂量对照，得到<strong>危害商</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>实际暴露剂量</mtext><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{HQ} = \\frac{\\text{实际暴露剂量}}{\\mathrm{RfD}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">HQ</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">RfD</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实际暴露剂量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>HQ 小于 1 表示暴露低于安全基准，风险可接受。多种物质或多途径共存时，把各 HQ 相加得<strong>危害指数（HI）</strong>，体现 <a href=\"../foundations/dose-response\">剂量-反应关系</a> 中的相加联合作用假设——这也是现实中混合暴露评估的常规做法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"致癌风险-线性外推与终生概率\">致癌风险：线性外推与终生概率</h2><p>对遗传毒性致癌物，主流假设是无阈，因此不存在「安全剂量」，只能计算不同暴露对应的风险概率。其核心基准是<strong>斜率因子（Slope Factor, SF）</strong>，即从动物高剂量数据低剂量线性外推得到的、单位剂量对应的终生超额致癌风险斜率（量纲为风险/(mg/kg/day)）。</p>\n<p>终生超额致癌风险用暴露剂量乘以斜率因子估算（低风险区近似线性）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></mrow><mo>×</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{Risk} = \\mathrm{LADD} \\times \\mathrm{SF}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">Risk</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">LADD</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SF</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 LADD 是终生平均日剂量。结果是一个概率，例如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\times10^{-5}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 意味着这种暴露使每十万人中额外增加约一例癌症。监管上通常把可接受致癌风险设在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 区间，具体取值随场景和人群规模而定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[动物高剂量致癌数据] --&gt; B[低剂量线性外推]&#10;  B --&gt; C[斜率因子 SF]&#10;  D[终生平均日剂量 LADD] --&gt; E[Risk = LADD x SF]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F{与可接受风险比较&lt;br/&gt;1e-6 ~ 1e-4}&#10;  F --&gt; G[风险管理决策]\">graph TD\n  A[动物高剂量致癌数据] --&gt; B[低剂量线性外推]\n  B --&gt; C[斜率因子 SF]\n  D[终生平均日剂量 LADD] --&gt; E[Risk = LADD x SF]\n  C --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F{与可接受风险比较&lt;br/&gt;1e-6 ~ 1e-4}\n  F --&gt; G[风险管理决策]</pre><h2 id=\"风险表征-不确定性与脆弱人群\">风险表征、不确定性与脆弱人群</h2><p>第四步风险表征把前三步整合成可供决策的结论，但它绝不只是套公式得一个数字，更要诚实地表达这个数字的<strong>不确定性与变异性</strong>。不确定性源于知识不足（可通过更多研究减少），变异性源于人群本身的固有差异（无法消除，只能刻画）。现代风险表征越来越多地用概率方法给出风险的分布而非单点，并明确说明保护的是哪类人群。</p>\n<p><strong>脆弱人群</strong>是人体健康风险评估的伦理与科学焦点。儿童因单位体重摄入量更高、行为更易接触污染、且处于 <a href=\"../foundations/toxicity-mechanisms\">毒性作用机制</a> 中强调的发育敏感窗口，往往比成人风险高得多；孕妇、老人、有基础疾病者同样需特别保护。把幼儿园建在污染场地之所以受严格审视，正是因为评估必须以最敏感受体为准——这与 <a href=\"../fate-exposure/exposure-assessment\">暴露评估</a> 中「合理最大暴露」情景的逻辑一脉相承。</p>\n<p>到 2026 年，人体健康风险评估正经历方法学转型：监管机构越来越多采用 <a href=\"testing-regulation\">毒理学测试与法规</a> 中的新方法学（NAMs）数据——高通量筛选、AOP、PBPK 反演——来加快缺乏传统毒性数据的化学品的评估，尤其面对 <a href=\"../pollutants/emerging-microplastics\">新兴污染物与微塑料</a> 中海量待评物质时。这一转型既提升效率，也带来如何把体外信号转化为可信 RfD 的新挑战。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>人体健康风险评估沿用「四步法」框架，保护对象是具体的人，尤其最脆弱的个体。</li>\n<li>评估对非致癌（有阈）与致癌（无阈）效应走两条路径，分叉源于剂量-反应的阈值假设。</li>\n<li>危害识别确定关键效应并整合流行病学、动物与机制证据，IARC 分类反映证据强度而非危害大小。</li>\n<li>非致癌路径从基准点除以不确定性系数得 RfD，再用 HQ&lt;1 判断；多物质叠加为危害指数 HI。</li>\n<li>致癌路径用斜率因子线性外推终生超额风险概率，监管可接受界常在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-6}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>风险表征须诚实表达不确定性与变异性，以脆弱人群为准，并正吸纳 NAMs 数据加速评估。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"人体健康风险","id":"人体健康风险"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"危害识别与证据整合","id":"危害识别与证据整合"},{"level":2,"text":"非致癌风险：从基准点到参考剂量","id":"非致癌风险-从基准点到参考剂量"},{"level":2,"text":"致癌风险：线性外推与终生概率","id":"致癌风险-线性外推与终生概率"},{"level":2,"text":"风险表征、不确定性与脆弱人群","id":"风险表征-不确定性与脆弱人群"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"生态风险评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/environmental-toxicology/risk/ecological-risk"},"next":{"title":"毒理学测试与法规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/environmental-toxicology/risk/testing-regulation"}}